translate schinese hscene48_Lyna_Helga_f1f7f82c:
    l "别害羞。把腿张开给我。"

translate schinese hscene48_Lyna_Helga_56b3a1d8:
    h "莱娜，别太过头，好吗？"

translate schinese hscene48_Lyna_Helga_b976fc26:
